<div class="content-card-item__content content-card-item__content--alt">
<div class="title title--module-sub-title content-card-item__ellipsis content-card-item__ellipsis--title">
Smart Loan
</div>
<p class="content-card-item__ellipsis">Smart Loan gives you up to N20M, if you have mutual funds investment with Stanbic IBTC Asset Management, a subsidiary of Stanbic IBTC Holdings. The loan can be accessed via the Stanbic IBTC Mobile App with no paperwork required</p>
</div>
<div class="content-card-item__link content-card-item__link--alt">
