Secured term loans
</div>
<p class="content-card-item__ellipsis">Get personal short term loan at a fixed monthly repayment amount to suit your lifestyle needs such as medical, house rent, car maintenance, school fee, wedding and pay it off at a time you feel comfortable with. 
</p>
